{"id":224339,"date":"2026-03-01T17:42:43","date_gmt":"2026-03-01T17:42:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/?page_id=224339"},"modified":"2026-09-01T10:12:52","modified_gmt":"2026-09-01T10:12:52","slug":"1st-assistant_program","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/1st-assistant_program\/","title":{"rendered":"PPS 1st Assistant Program \u2013 Special access for assistants &#038; techs"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section_0 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_flex_section\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_0 et_pb_row et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_0 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_24_24 et_flex_column_24_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_0 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h1 class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>1st Assistant Special Access <\/b>for<br \/>Photo Assistants &amp; Digital Techs<br \/>Program von ProPhotoSkills.com<\/h1>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"769\">Learn like a lead. Think like a photographer.<\/strong><br data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\" \/>Special lifetime access for photo assistants who want to grow beyond the set.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1138\">The <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1035\">1st Assistant Program<\/strong> is a <strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1074\">special lifetime access offer<\/strong> for photo assistants, lighting assistants, and digital techs.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1296\">It exists for one simple reason:<br data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1180\" \/>Most assistants don\u2019t decide the budget \u2014 but they strongly influence the workflow, mindset, and quality on set.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1479\">This program allows assistants to access the <strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1391\">full ProPhotoSkills \u2013 Next Level system<\/strong> at a reduced price, <strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1478\">when the guide is requested as a professional development tool<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h3 data-section-id=\"5yckop\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1559\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1559\">How it works<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1626\">You are a <strong data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1624\">photo assistant \/ 1st assistant \/ digital tech<br \/><\/strong>1. You tell your photographer or studio lead:<\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1953\">\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1953\"><em data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1763\">\u201cI want to work more independently, think ahead, and support productions better<\/em><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1626\">2. You request the guide as a <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1832\">professional training investment<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1626\">3. You receive <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1880\">Lifetime Membership \u2013 \u20ac300<\/strong><\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1953\">\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1953\">No upsells. No tiers. No bullshit. One system. Lifetime access.<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_1 et_pb_row et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_1 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_3_5 et_flex_column_3_5_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h3 data-section-id=\"1ffii2o\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2051\"><strong>Why photographers say yes<\/strong><strong><\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2254\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1oloblg\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2110\">\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2110\">Assistants think <strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2092\">production-first<\/strong>, not gear-first<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hddyfa\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2154\">\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2154\">Better preparation = less stress on set<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gg2zr0\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2207\">\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2207\">Shared language between photographer &amp; assistant<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"z4q1hx\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2254\">\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2254\">Fewer mistakes, faster setups, better flow<br \/>This is not a \u201ccourse\u201d.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2324\">It\u2019s a <strong data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2323\">production mindset upgrade<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_2 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_2_5 et_flex_column_2_5_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h3 data-section-id=\"xe19fa\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2417\"><strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2417\">1st Assistant \u2013 Lifetime Membership<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2437\"><strong data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2437\">\u20ac300 \u2013 one time<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&#x2714; Full access to all guides<\/p>\n<p>&#x2714; Future updates included<br \/><br data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\" \/>&#x2714; International \/ <br \/>\u00a0 \u00a0 multi-language ready<br \/><br data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2538\" \/>&#x2714; No subscription<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_2 et_pb_row et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_3 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_24_24 et_flex_column_24_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h4 class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Use it as your next professional development request<\/h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Apply for the 1st Assistant Program<\/h4>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_7 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h2><strong>Contact Us:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3179\">This offer is intended for active assistants and digital techs.<br data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2938\" \/>Access may be limited to maintain program quality.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3242\"><a data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3204\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\">support@prophotoskills.com<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-rtl-flip=\"\" class=\"block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]\"><use href=\"\/cdn\/assets\/sprites-core-bfiuxdzr.svg#304883\" fill=\"currentColor\"><\/use><\/svg><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-224339","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"htt